    "text": "theadvocate.com\nwebsite\nBaton Rouge\nA year after Keith Lee visited, this smoothie spot opens a second location in Baton Rouge\nBy SERENA PUANG,\n1 days agoA year after Keith Lee visited Baton Rouge, Dr. Feel Good, a local organic wellness store, is opening a second location. “Hey, @keith_lee125,” they wrote in a post on social media. “It’s officially been one year since you paid us a visit — and you were right, we needed help.”\n14",
